{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜網約車駕駛許可證申請(二)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-27-13-04-057ZzNPAdX.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：網約車駕駛許可證申請</p><p>運輸署下周一起接受網約車車輛駕駛許可證「人牌」申請，上限一萬個，當中有甚麼申請資格？業界的反應是怎樣？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>立法會議員(航運交通界)林銘鋒</p><p>汽總的士分會主任何志強</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T05:43:50.787022+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T05:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T08:57:31.654035+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T05:37:20.578082+00:00","content_hash":"ed3edde27968038def257e56122b23c2116f11bc5f11d30c1cec6f01b2c5b13a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}